[opnpc1,ahoy_ghost_farmer]
// osrs
~chatplayer("<p,neutral>Your animals don't look too healthy.");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>It's that fountain thingy in the temple to the east. It's turned them all into zombies.");
~chatplayer("<p,neutral>What use are zombie animals?");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>None at all, mate, except that those worshippers at that temple keep comin' and killin' 'em all for their bones. Don't ask me why.");
~chatplayer("<p,quiz>But you're a ghost - surely you know|something about it.");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>I don't know nuthin' about nuthin'. Oim a simple ghost with simple needs. All I know is, years ago, that temple started glowing green and, a few months later, I woke up dead. That's all there is to it.");